#. Key:	646A929F45E462DCC86302927DE95A39
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/GrimrockPrototype/Core/DataAssets/RPG/Visuals/PortraitSets/DA_PortraitSet_Dwarf.DA_PortraitSet_Dwarf.MalePortraits(1).MalePortraits.Description
