#. Key:	7134561F403D2E6031F70BB3FA83D155
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/GrimrockPrototype/Core/DataAssets/RPG/Visuals/PortraitSets/DA_PortraitSet_Elf.DA_PortraitSet_Elf.FemalePortraits(2).FemalePortraits.Description
