#. Key:	35CB961F4398E2B09BD8B98208112410
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/GrimrockPrototype/Core/DataAssets/RPG/Visuals/PortraitSets/DA_PortraitSet_Gnome.DA_PortraitSet_Gnome.FemalePortraits(4).FemalePortraits.Description
