#. Key:	76FFAB43451E4DE45E0995A0F285D309
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/GrimrockPrototype/Core/DataAssets/RPG/Visuals/PortraitSets/DA_PortraitSet_Halfling.DA_PortraitSet_Halfling.MalePortraits(3).MalePortraits.Description
