#. Key:	F9C77BA147A8B9314B4A5FAD8C855598
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/GrimrockPrototype/Core/DataAssets/RPG/Visuals/PortraitSets/DA_PortraitSet_HalfOrc.DA_PortraitSet_HalfOrc.FemalePortraits(2).FemalePortraits.Description
